flowchart TD
    SESSION["active session starts (delivery/share)"] --> PERM{foreground and background location permission? Ch 51}
    PERM -->|denied| DEGRADE["rationale / settings / degrade (Ch 51)"]
    PERM -->|granted| FGS["location foreground service + visible notification (Ch 46)"]
    FGS --> FUSED["FusedLocationProvider: priority + interval per use case"]
    FUSED --> FILTER["filter noisy/low-accuracy fixes + timestamp"]
    FILTER --> STREAM["stream over WebSocket (Ch 63)"]
    STREAM --> OUTBOX["buffer in outbox when offline (Ch 31)"]
    OUTBOX -->|reconnect| FLUSH["flush in order (Ch 63)"]
    STREAM --> BACKEND["backend: authed, access-controlled (Ch 19/23)"]
    END["session ends / share expires"] --> STOP["STOP FGS + location requests - battery + privacy"]
    PRIVACY["least precision/retention + indicator + consent (Ch 28)"] -.-> FUSED
